    { "f": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/eli/cz/sb/1963/99/2024-07-01/dokument/norma/cast_3/hlava_4/par_174/odst_1" }	, "order": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "6BE3C3D580" }	, "cit": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "\u00A7 174 odst. 1" }	, "c": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/pr\u00E1vn\u00ED-akt-fragment/739651" }	, "type": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/cis-esb-typ-fragmentu/polo\u017Eka/Odstavec_Dc" }	, "text": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "<var>(1)</var> Platebn\u00ED rozkaz, proti n\u011Bmu\u017E nebyl pod\u00E1n odpor, m\u00E1 \u00FA\u010Dinky pravomocn\u00E9ho rozsudku." }},
    { "f": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/eli/cz/sb/1963/99/2024-07-01/dokument/norma/cast_3/hlava_4/par_174/odst_2" }	, "order": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "6BE3C3D680" }	, "cit": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "\u00A7 174 odst. 2" }	, "c": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/pr\u00E1vn\u00ED-akt-fragment/739657" }	, "type": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/cis-esb-typ-fragmentu/polo\u017Eka/Odstavec_Dc" }	, "text": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "<var>(2)</var> Pod\u00E1-li i jen jeden ze \u017Ealovan\u00FDch v\u010Das odpor, ru\u0161\u00ED se t\u00EDm platebn\u00ED rozkaz v pln\u00E9m rozsahu a soud na\u0159\u00EDd\u00ED jedn\u00E1n\u00ED. Opravn\u00FDm prost\u0159edkem jen proti v\u00FDroku o n\u00E1kladech \u0159\u00EDzen\u00ED je v\u0161ak i zde odvol\u00E1n\u00ED." }},
    { "f": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/eli/cz/sb/1963/99/2024-07-01/dokument/norma/cast_3/hlava_4/par_174/odst_3" }	, "order": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "6BE3C3D780" }	, "cit": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "\u00A7 174 odst. 3" }	, "c": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/pr\u00E1vn\u00ED-akt-fragment/739663" }	, "type": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/cis-esb-typ-fragmentu/polo\u017Eka/Odstavec_Dc" }	, "text": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "<var>(3)</var> Pozd\u011B podan\u00FD odpor soud usnesen\u00EDm odm\u00EDtne; pro nedostatek od\u016Fvodn\u011Bn\u00ED nelze odpor odm\u00EDtnout. Podan\u00FD odpor soud odm\u00EDtne t\u00E9\u017E tehdy, podal-li jej ten, kdo k pod\u00E1n\u00ED odporu nen\u00ED opr\u00E1vn\u011Bn." }} ] } }